  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvki8921a7dsezk3egct2ogip@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvki8921a7dsezk3egct2ogip/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33331170305&amp;signature=bkg68UpYJDbhwxjoXFzq1X9dG0g%3D&amp;ts=1774261505\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvki8921a7dsezk3egct2ogip?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2a2k4OTIxYTdkc2V6azNlZ2N0Mm9naXAiLCJ0aWQiOiIyMTZmYTZhNy0zOTAwLTQ2YjItODc3YS0zNzRkYjYwZmUyZWIiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODUyOTd9.pQ55sIPwRfbr-HTALMKbTgZgIFLJeiHiAMgBp-M9XhewJhL-FzkH0SGbh167O6rv6kVTVSrYIfLcXIybr-8MNg&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4e3ba251383cd8acf2fd92ed7037abe3d8adb80f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4e3ba251383cd8acf2fd92ed7037abe3d8adb80f\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"205\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b>SNS에 유행하던 리듬게임입니다.</b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">재미, </span>보장합니다. ^^</b><br>우선 <b>이미지로 연습</b>을 한 후,<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e00bca54b6d8a761f14f0eee4bf18fa0ac6b373e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"146\" height=\"116\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e00bca54b6d8a761f14f0eee4bf18fa0ac6b373e\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"238\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c6fd1f3e843a6b188d70dbb91d0c51f8489ae709\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"129\" height=\"100\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c6fd1f3e843a6b188d70dbb91d0c51f8489ae709\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"233\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a301c48b9ea4bc82366a18bad82e597484dc0a04\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"110\" height=\"99\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a301c48b9ea4bc82366a18bad82e597484dc0a04\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"270\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ee53306e4ebe6efb72696cf49014b73e9488146d\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"112\" height=\"109\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ee53306e4ebe6efb72696cf49014b73e9488146d\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"292\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">처음에는 천천히&#160;<br>점점 빠르게 하면&#160;<br>몹시 좋아합니다.&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">1.5배속도</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">해내는 학</span><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">생</span></b><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">들이 있습니다!</span></b><br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&lt;캡컷&gt;에서 </span></b><br>템플릿으로 제작가능하고<br>간단합니다.&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #ef5369;\">2분컷 가능!</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba41d732333b2b3225638b1b03474f6863dea909\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba41d732333b2b3225638b1b03474f6863dea909\" data-origin-width=\"500\" data-origin-height=\"986\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b>상단에 &#39;리듬게임&#39; 검색 후</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">고양이 그림</span></b>, 요녀석 템플릿을 클릭!<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/79076eead37ab0de33804df05d196d7d2d907906\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/79076eead37ab0de33804df05d196d7d2d907906\" data-origin-width=\"500\" data-origin-height=\"1020\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">이미지를 클릭하시고<br><b>이미지가 뜨면</b><br>&#160;<br>총 5개 미션,<br><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">한 미션당 8개의 이미지</span></b>를<br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">아래 버튼으로 일일이 클릭합니다&#160;</span></b><br>&#160;<br>비슷한 것을 반복해서 넣으면 쉬워지고<br><b>섞으면 어려워집니다.&#160;</b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #8a3db6;\">어휘가 낯선 단원에&#160;</span></b><br>몹시 좋은듯 합니다.<br>&#160;<br>&#128522;&#128522;&#128522;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa7a7a586cf97d7003faa6949afcbb3c61821ca7?download\" data-file-name=\"리듬게임.mp4\" data-file-size=\"12365495\" data-mimetype=\"video/mp4\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1570%26fileid%3D10%26regdt%3D20260323193332&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Ffa7a7a586cf97d7003faa6949afcbb3c61821ca7')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span c